OL,3,A'Below the dignity of the office':
OL,4,ACanadian officials condemn Pete Hegseth
OL,5,Acadet post
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth is
OL,8,Funder fire in Canada for a social media
OL,9,Fpost that appears to mock members of
OL,10,Fthe country's cadet youth programme.
OL,12,FHegseth posted the image, taken from
OL,13,Fthe social media account for a local
OL,14,Ftraining branch, showing a young cadet
OL,15,Freceiving an award from her instructor.
OL,17,FHe added a Canadian flag emoji and the
OL,18,Fcaption "this is real" - an apparent
OL,19,Fattempt at disparaging Canada's
OL,20,Fmilitary by making fun of the pair's
OL,21,Fappearance.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
