OL,3,A'Below the dignity of the office':
OL,4,ACanadian officials condemn Pete Hegseth
OL,5,Acadet post
OL,6,
OL,7,FCanadian Defence Minister David
OL,8,FMcGuinty said on Tuesday that Hegseth's
OL,9,Fpost was "below the dignity of the
OL,10,Foffice".
